      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "ceb_hook",
      "narration": "Why do zebras have stripes?",
      "on_screen_text": "Why the stripes?",
      "highlight_words": [
        "stripes?"
      ],
      "sfx": "impact",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "ceb_unique",
      "narration": "First, a fact: no two zebras have the same stripes.",
      "on_screen_text": "No two alike",
      "highlight_words": [
        "alike"
      ],
      "sfx": "pop",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "ceb_skin",
      "narration": "And under the fur, their skin is dark: they're really black with white stripes.",
      "on_screen_text": "Black with white stripes?",
      "highlight_words": [
        "Black"
      ],
      "sfx": "ding",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "ceb_ideas",
      "narration": "For a long time people thought they were for camouflage or for keeping cool.",
      "on_screen_text": "Lots of ideas",
      "highlight_words": [
        "ideas"
      ],
      "sfx": "none",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "ceb_flies",
      "narration": "But the explanation with the most evidence involves biting flies: horseflies.",
      "on_screen_text": "Blame the flies",
      "highlight_words": [
        "flies"
      ],
      "sfx": "riser",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "ceb_miss",
      "narration": "The stripes seem to confuse them: they fly close, but can't brake properly and rarely land.",
      "on_screen_text": "They can't land",
      "highlight_words": [
        "land"
      ],
      "sfx": "whoosh",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "ceb_africa",
      "narration": "Also, in places with more flies, zebras tend to have bolder stripes.",
      "on_screen_text": "More flies, bolder stripes",
      "highlight_words": [
        "stripes"
      ],
      "sfx": "none",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "ceb_family",
      "narration": "And since every pattern is unique, they may also help a mother and foal recognize each other.",
      "on_screen_text": "Mom and foal",
      "highlight_words": [
        "foal"
      ],
      "sfx": "none",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s9",
      "role": "surprise",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "ceb_experiment",
      "narration": "In one experiment, horses were dressed in striped coats, and horseflies landed on them far less!",
      "on_screen_text": "Horses in zebra pajamas!",
      "highlight_words": [
        "pajamas!"
      ],
      "sfx": "ding",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
